WEBVTT

00:02:56.663 --> 00:03:00.329
utashangaa jinsi ambavyo hewa safi inasababisha mazungumzo safi,

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.913
na katika hali hii,

00:03:01.913 --> 00:03:05.454
utaleta mawazo mapya katika maisha yako.

00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.163
Asante.

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:11.413
(Makofi)